      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the launch plan for the new painkiller. We really need this campaign to land hard with \"Superior Rapid Action and Patient Comfort\" to differentiate us from the generics. Looking at the clinical data we have, does it support us leaning heavily into those two specific selling points (speed and comfort) for the main campaign? We need to move fast on this.",
